// Intentionally empty of rules.
//
// The streaming capture output and its window-placement rule are BOTH written
// per-session by Sunshine's prep-cmd into stream-output.kdl, which is included
// ahead of this file. They have to be dynamic: niri window-rule matchers cannot
// scope to an output, so a static fullscreen rule would apply even when nothing
// is streaming, and a static output block would be shadowed anyway (output
// blocks are first-match-wins).
//
// Kept as a placeholder so the include in config.kdl stays valid and there is an
// obvious place for future host-neutral output overrides.
